{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Make the step-body canary replay-visible**\n\nThis step inherits the durable context's replay-aware logger, so this INFO record is suppressed while replaying. If a regression executes `unexpected_step` before rejecting the identity mismatch, the canary remains absent and requirement 11-1 cannot detect the forbidden execution. Cast `step_context.logger` to the concrete `Logger` and emit through `with_is_replaying(lambda: False)` so the execution metadata is preserved while the canary remains visible.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7sMgcZ","finding_digest":"82bcda4537c37c562b6d8c5a2bdd00043e92577b9a4a2588bc5c37d289ef6fd6","finding_id":"arf_v1_qk6nurjxyn6fmk3nrrncxxiaaq","finding_key":"conformance/replay_operation_identity.py::unexpected_step::replay-visible-body-canary","identity_key":"conformance/replay_operation_identity.py::unexpected_step::replay-visible-body-canary","line":14,"observation_digest":"3410b97364c84df9e5f25bcd9d9af88ec25672f8aac1b4be0034df5afb5fd333","observation_id":"aro_v1_gqils43ezbg7tzpslpgz3gxyr3","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-conformance-tests/handlers/general/replay_operation_identity.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_qk6nurjxyn6fmk3nrrncxxiaaq","published_at":"2026-09-08T22:09:37Z","review_id":"arr_v1_s5joipr5yn6hrqvrjapkqidnkl","reviewed_base_sha":"b7b10c7f5640615a4974b793b7618dfb4a37a59b","reviewed_head_sha":"cd186ca793a12ec9d5fe7f95c1aae1d321b31691","reviewer":"codex","start_line":14,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":701},"record_id":"art_v1_iucaj7g4al7zin26wqgi7gwqah","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T22:09:37Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
